All the images in bunsen-images and bunsen-images-base are currently released under
GPL-3.0+ or GPL-2.0+ licenses.

The wallpaper images pawel-czerwinski-bark.png and pawel-czerwinski-sage.png have been
modified from images originally released under the unsplash license by Pawel Czerwinski.
https://unsplash.com/@pawel_czerwinski

The wallpaper image mirage_hhh is based on Mirage,
a Debian trixie theme proposal by Juliette Taka.
https://wiki.debian.org/DebianArt/Themes/Mirage
http://www.juliettetaka.com/fr
